{"id": "ru-db8c01f74166.ru", "jokeId": "ru-db8c01f74166", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source wording kept. The traffic cop (traffic-cop costume, striped baton) walks up through the clouds to God (ded in the god costume) at the gate on 'Предстал перед богом'; nod, shrug, God points to the roads, the cop points at the spot on the punchline. Heaven has no fork of roads yet — requested.", "title": "Перекрёсток", "location": "nebesa", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "ded"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "traffic-cop", "ded": "god"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Умер гаишник. Предстал перед богом.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Тот спрашивает:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Ну что ты, сын мой, делал ли ты людям добро?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Да, бывало.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "ded", "text": "А зло?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "И такое было.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Ну, вот тебе две дороги, одна в рай, другая в ад.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Какую выберешь, туда и попадешь.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Мент отвечает:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "А можно я здесь, на перекрестке останусь?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "nebesa", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "ded"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "traffic-cop", "ded": "god"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "ded", "to": "gate"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "from": "off-left", "to": "left"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "sluzhivy", "item": "baton-striped", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"ty